01	Display.Conversation	Blacksmith	Mind the forge, it's hot!\Bring me ore from the mines: copper and tin make bronze, iron makes iron, and iron with coal makes steel.\With bars and some logs you can make your own tools. Better tools dig and chop faster.	Let me use the forge.	02	What do you sell?	07	Where are the mines?	09	Goodbye.	10
